      "verifiedIndependently": "The finding was re-checked before being accepted, not taken on trust: .spec/platform-distribution.md:103-105 mandates the two exceptions; .research/260721_macos-self-update.md:111-113 records the same two-value set; and six shipping applications on this Mac were read with codesign -d --entitlements :- and carry exactly the <bundle-id>-spks / -spki pattern. CONFIRMED.",
      "introduces": [
        "X1-A1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "revision": "2026-07-28.r2",
      "closes": [
