      "portalNote": "Keychain sharing is not a separate portal App ID record. The group must fall inside the generated profile's keychain-access-groups allowlist. Verified 2026-07-28 on this Mac: a Mac Development profile's Entitlements dict carries keychain-access-groups = ['<TEAMID>.*'], a team-wide wildcard, so 262RZ595FP.works.relux.tunnel.shared is authorised without a dedicated portal record. r5: this remains true and remains iOS-scoped in effect - no macOS target claims the group, so no macOS profile has to authorize it.",
