        "text": "NO iOS development profile is created or checked at Ceremony C1: all four declare profiles[].development.devices as deferred under ADR-024, so there is no declared device set to compare a profile against yet. When an iOS development profile is later created, its ProvisionedDevices is compared against the device set this contract declares for that target AT THAT TIME — never against the macOS device set, and never by falling through to A9a"
