        "text": "CONTAINMENT — every entitlement key present in the signed bundle is in the computed allowlist: authored keys (status required or required-adjacent) UNION entitlementClassification.signingGenerated[platform].always UNION, on the development channel only, entitlementClassification.signingGenerated[platform].developmentChannelOnly"
